WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:06.930
Should you walk if your knee hurts? Usually, yes. Walking keeps the joint moving, and the muscles strong.

00:07.430 --> 00:14.230
Start small. Short walks, more often. Ten minutes, two or three times a day, is better than one long walk.

00:14.730 --> 00:21.060
Walk on flat ground, in shoes with good cushioning. Avoid slopes and uneven paths at first.

00:21.560 --> 00:29.300
If you use a walking stick, hold it in the hand opposite your sore knee. So if your right knee hurts, hold the stick in your left hand.

00:29.800 --> 00:36.880
A mild ache that settles by the next day is okay. Next time, walk the same amount, before you add more.

00:37.380 --> 00:44.290
See your doctor if your knee swells, locks, or gives way, or if the pain keeps you awake at night.
